      <a class="gsr-learn-more" href="https://www.globalsitroom.com/our-services">Learn More</a>
    </div>
  </article>
  <article class="gsr-card" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Expand Reputation Risk Index">
    <div class="gsr-card-photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Reputation Risk Index Q1 2026"></div>
    <div class="gsr-card-top">
      <h3 class="gsr-card-title">Reputation Risk<br>Index</h3>
      <span class="gsr-expand" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
          <polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline>
          <line x1="21" y1="3" x2="14" y2="10"></line>
          <line x1="3" y1="21" x2="10" y2="14"></line>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="gsr-card-detail" hidden>
      <p>The Reputation Risk Index&trade; is a quarterly barometer of emerging and evolving reputational threats to companies and organizations. The Index combines data from the Global Situation Room's team of crisis experts and analysis from more than 130 preeminent public affairs leaders, from former heads of state and ministers to current CEOs and senior executives who serve on the Global Risk Advisory Council&trade;.</p>
      <a class="gsr-learn-more" href="https://www.globalsitroom.com/reputational-risk-index">Learn More</a>
    </div>
  </article>
  <article class="gsr-card" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Expand Podcast Production">
    <div class="gsr-card-photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="On-location broadcast interview"></div>
    <div class="gsr-card-top">
      <h3 class="gsr-card-title">Podcast<br>Production</h3>
      <span class="gsr-expand" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
          <polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline>
          <line x1="21" y1="3" x2="14" y2="10"></line>
          <line x1="3" y1="21" x2="10" y2="14"></line>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="gsr-card-detail" hidden>
      <h4>We Deliver Powerful Podcasts that Drive the Debate</h4>
      <p><strong>Unrivaled Access to Global Leaders.</strong> Securing the most powerful people on the planet.</p>
      <p><strong>Making News.</strong> A PR News Top 100 agency to secure headlines.</p>
      <p><strong>International Impact.</strong> Chart-topping shows in every major market around the world.</p>
      <a class="gsr-learn-more" href="https://www.globalsitroom.com/podcast-production">Learn More</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
<!-- The pop-out. One modal serves all three cards; it fills with the clicked card's content. -->
<div class="gsr-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="gsr-modal-backdrop"></div>
  <div class="gsr-modal-box">
    <button class="gsr-modal-close" aria-label="Close">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <polyline points="4 14 10 14 10 20"></polyline>
        <polyline points="20 10 14 10 14 4"></polyline>
        <line x1="14" y1="10" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
        <line x1="3" y1="21" x2="10" y2="14"></line>
      </svg>
    </button>
    <h2 class="gsr-modal-title"></h2>
    <div class="gsr-modal-body"></div>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .gsr-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: stretch;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .gsr-card {
    flex: 1 1 220px;         /* equal widths, can shrink and wrap */
    min-width: 0;            /* prevents flex item from overflowing on long titles */
    max-width: 260px;      /* keeps the card from stretching wide in bigger containers */
    min-height: 0;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;   /* locks in the "tall rectangle" look regardless of container width */
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;  /* title sits at the bottom, over the photo */
    padding: 18px 16px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    /* CARD BACKGROUND GSR navy, shows only behind/under the photo */
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #021B55 0%, #0A2B72 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .gsr-card:hover,
  .gsr-card:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(2, 27, 85, 0.35);
    outline: none;
  }
  /* PREVIEW PHOTO now fills the whole card, with a navy scrim at the bottom
     so the title stays readable. Less blue, more photo. */
  .gsr-card-photo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .gsr-card-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .gsr-card-photo::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(2, 27, 85, 0.95) 0%, rgba(2, 27, 85, 0.75) 22%, rgba(2, 27, 85, 0.12) 55%, rgba(2, 27, 85, 0) 75%);
  }
  .gsr-card-top {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .gsr-card-title {
    /* TITLE styling white, for contrast against the navy card */
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }
  .gsr-expand {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #021B55;            /* ICON COLOR GSR navy */
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .gsr-expand svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  .gsr-card:hover .gsr-expand,
  .gsr-card:focus-visible .gsr-expand {
    background: #021B55;
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px #ffffff;
  }
  /* ---------- The pop-out modal ---------- */
  .gsr-modal {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 9999;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .gsr-modal.gsr-open { display: flex; }
  .gsr-modal-backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(20, 18, 45, 0.55);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
            backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
    animation: gsr-fade 0.2s ease;
  }
  .gsr-modal-box {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    max-height: 78vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 32px 32px 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(20, 18, 45, 0.35);
    animation: gsr-pop 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .gsr-modal-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #021B55;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .gsr-modal-close:hover {
    background: #021B55;
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px #ffffff;
  }
  .gsr-modal-close svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
  /* "Learn More" button shown at the bottom of each card's expanded detail */
  .gsr-learn-more {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background: #021B55;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }
  .gsr-learn-more:hover { background: #0A2B72; }
  .gsr-modal-title {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 90%;
  }
  .gsr-modal-body {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #45455a;
  }
  .gsr-modal-body p { margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .gsr-modal-body h4 {
    margin: 18px 0 5px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #021B55;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .gsr-modal-body h4:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  @keyframes gsr-fade { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
  @keyframes gsr-pop {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px) scale(0.97); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
  }
  /* Stack the cards on mobile */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .gsr-cards { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    .gsr-card { max-width: 260px; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; }
    .gsr-modal-box { padding: 28px 22px 24px; }
    .gsr-modal-title { font-size: 21px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .gsr-card, .gsr-modal-backdrop, .gsr-modal-box { animation: none; transition: none; }
  }
</style>
<script>
  (function () {
    var cards  = document.querySelectorAll('.gsr-cards .gsr-card');
    var modal  = document.querySelector('.gsr-modal');
    if (!modal) return;
    var box    = modal.querySelector('.gsr-modal-box');
    var mTitle = modal.querySelector('.gsr-modal-title');
    var mBody  = modal.querySelector('.gsr-modal-body');
    var closeBtn = modal.querySelector('.gsr-modal-close');
    var lastFocused = null;
    function openCard(card) {
      lastFocused = card;
      // Pull the title (turn the <br> into a real space) and the hidden detail HTML
      var titleClone = card.querySelector('.gsr-card-title').cloneNode(true);
      titleClone.querySelectorAll('br').forEach(function (br) { br.replaceWith(' '); });
      mTitle.textContent = titleClone.textContent.replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
      mBody.innerHTML = card.querySelector('.gsr-card-detail').innerHTML;
      modal.classList.add('gsr-open');
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';   // stop background scroll
      closeBtn.focus();
    }
    function closeCard() {
      modal.classList.remove('gsr-open');
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
      document.body.style.overflow = '';
      if (lastFocused) lastFocused.focus();
    }
    cards.forEach(function (card) {
      card.addEventListener('click', function () { openCard(card); });
      // Keyboard: Enter or Space opens, since the card is a button
      card.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
        if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); openCard(card); }
      });
    });
    closeBtn.addEventListener('click', closeCard);
    modal.querySelector('.gsr-modal-backdrop').addEventListener('click', closeCard);
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
      if (e.key === 'Escape' && modal.classList.contains('gsr-open')) closeCard();
    });
  })();
</script>

</body></html>
